{"id":"7e9b685ff101acd9","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-thm-martins-max.md","title":"Martin's Maximum","display":"thm-martins-max — Martin's Maximum","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-martins-max","aliases":["58-thm-martins-max"],"display":"thm-martins-max — Martin's Maximum","depends_on":["[[58-df-zfc-forcing-martin-maximum-instance]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-martins-max"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-martins-max</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-martins-max — Martin's Maximum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06d18f40679c17c6\" href=\"?note=06d18f40679c17c6\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-martin-maximum-instance\">58-df-zfc-forcing-martin-maximum-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1cd156e08cdc8ce0\" href=\"?note=1cd156e08cdc8ce0\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset\">58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MM}\\in\\mathsf{Sentence}\">\\(\\mathrm{MM}\\in\\mathsf{Sentence}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}max} \\vdash \\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\\forall P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_1\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}max} \\vdash \\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\\forall P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_1\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MM extends Martin's axiom from c.c.c. forcing to stationary-set-preserving forcing.</li>\n<li>It implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{c} = \\aleph_2\">\\(\\mathfrak{c} = \\aleph_2\\)</span> and many combinatorial consequences.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-martin-maximum-instance","status":"resolved","id":"06d18f40679c17c6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-martin-maximum-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset","status":"resolved","id":"1cd156e08cdc8ce0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-stationary-set-preserving-poset]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{MM}\\in\\mathsf{Sentence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}martins\\text{-}max} \\vdash \\mathrm{MM}\\leftrightarrow\\forall P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D\\in V\\;\\left(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingStationarySetPreservingPoset}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\omega_1)\\land|\\mathcal D|\\leq\\aleph_1\\land\\forall D\\in\\mathcal D\\;\\left(D\\subseteq P\\land\\forall p\\in P\\;\\exists q\\in D\\;(q\\leq_Pp)\\right)\\to\\mathrm{ZfcForcingMartinMaximumInstance}_S(P,\\leq_P,\\mathcal D)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{c} = \\aleph_2","display":false}],"bytes":1121,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4302","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-thm-martins-max.md|58-thm-martins-max]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["06d18f40679c17c6","1cd156e08cdc8ce0"]}